# natives.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester, against
# fl-engine's frame through emblema (docs/m2-dart-ui.md §9). Percent of
# pixels allowed to differ in any channel, and by more than 32.
#
# Edges, as for shapes, and one more kind of difference: inside the
# translucent layers (the saveLayer cell, the clip layers' Opacity) most
# pixels are one level off, the rounding of a layer's alpha. That is why
# "differ" is wide here; by more than 2, 1.39%. Measured 2026-10-28,
# lavapipe: 5.048% differ, 0.335% by more than 32.
differ 7.0
differ_over_32 0.6
